 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Batteries are inserted in circular order 0, 1, ..., n-1, 0, 1, ... starting at time 0 with every battery fully charged. Battery i, once inserted, powers the call for usageDuration[i] minutes and is then drained; it is fully recharged chargeTime[i] minutes after it was drained. When the phone battery runs out the next battery in order is inserted at once and must already be fully recharged; otherwise the call ends. Return the minimum number of insertions after which the total powered time is at least duration, or -1 if the call ends first.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk07-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
